hadiths[64]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1322","Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) ne bayan farmaya ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ek khane ke dher ke paas se guzre. Aap (ﷺ) ne apna ungli us mein daali aur namki mehsoos farmai. Aap (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Aye khane ke maalik! Yeh kya hai?\"" Us ne arz ki: \""Is par barish aa gayi hai"
"1323","Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) se marwi hai ke: Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne ek khaas umar ka udhaar oont liya. Phir unhain us se behtar umar ka oont wapas kiya. Aap (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Tum mein se behtar woh hai jo ada karne mein behtar ho.\"" Qaal: Is mein Abu Rafi' (رضي الله عنه) se bhi kuch hai. [Abu Eisa (رحمه الله) ne kaha:] Abu Hurairah (رضي الله"""""
"1324","Jābir (raḍiyallāhu ʿanhu) ne riwāyat kihi ke Nabī Kareem (ṣallallāhu ʿalayhi wa sallam) ne *muḥāqalah*, *muzābanah*, *mukhābarah*, aur *muʿāwamah* se manfarmāyā, aur *ʿarāyā* ke bāre mein rukhṣat (concession) dī. Abū ʿĪsā (al-Tirmidhī) ne farmāyā: Yeh ḥasan ṣaḥīḥ hadīth hai.\n\n\n\nManhiyāt (Prohibited Transactions) ke ʿIlmī Ḥawāle\n\nYeh hadīth, Jābir ibn ʿAbdillāh (raḍiyallāhu ʿanhu) ki riwāyat se, jo al-Tirmidhī ne darj kī, kuch zirāʿat aur falon se mutaʿalliq muʿāmlāt ko mutaʿarraf kartī hai jinhe Nabī Kareem (ṣallallāhu ʿalayhi wa sallam) ne unke andar maujūd *gharar* (zyādah se zyādah ghair yaqīnīyat) aur *ribā* (sūd) se mushābahat kī bāz se manfarmāyā. Manhiyāt ke iṣṭilāḥāt darjā bālā hain:\n\n1. Al-Muḥāqalah (المحاقلة): Ghalle ke phal ko abhi bādal (unthreshed) hote hue, thaile hue ghalle ke badle mein bechnā. Is mein ghair yaqīnīyat hai, kyunke ākhirī paidāwār kā pata nahīṅ chaltā.\n\n2. Al-Muzābanah (المزابنة): Khajūr ke darakht par naram (unripe) khajūr ko, sukhī (tamr) khajūr ke badle mein andāz se bechnā, bāʿd-e-ḥaṣād ke bīnā par wazn yā paimāish ke.\n\n3. Al-Mukhābarah (المخابرة): Ek aqārdārī (share-cropping) kā muʿāmlā jismeiṅ zamīndār zamīn de detā hai kāshtkār ko, paidāwār ke hisse ke badle mein, aksar taqsīm mein ghair yaqīnīyat hotī hai.\n\n4. Al-Muʿāwamah (المعاومة): Phalon ke paidāwār ko ek do sāl pahle bechnā, jabke woh paidā hī nahīṅ hue, yeh *gharar* se bharpūr ek āge kā muʿāmlā hai.\n\nAl-ʿArāyā (العرايا) kī Rukhṣat\n\nNabī Kareem (ṣallallāhu ʿalayhi wa sallam) ne *ʿarāyā* ke bāre mein rukhṣat dī, jismeiṅ darakht par tāzā khajūr ko, sukhī khajūr ke badle mein andāz se bechnā, ḵās taur par muhaddas miqdār (ām taur par pāṅch *awsq* yā us se kam) ke liye, zarūratmand kī madad ke liye. Yeh istisnā Abū Hurayrah (raḍiyallāhu ʿanhu) aur dusron kī hadīth par mabnī hai, jismeiṅ Nabī Kareem (ṣallallāhu ʿalayhi wa sallam) ne rahm aur zarūrat kī buniyād par is muʿāmlat kī ijāzat dī, sharṭ yeh ke woh insāf se anjām dīyā jāe.\n\nDarja-bandī\n\nAbū ʿĪsā Muḥammad ibn ʿĪsā al-Tirmidhī (raḥimahullāh) ne is riwāyat ko ḥasan ṣaḥīḥ (achchī aur sahīh) darje meṅ rakhā, iske Islāmī fiqh meṅ etbār kī taṣdīq karte hue."
"1325","tw yqynaً malkِ hq kw hq hay kh wh bwlay۔ phr anhwn nay frmaya: as kay lyay ayk awn khryd kr asay day dya jayay۔ phr lwgwn nay jstjw ky، mgr anhwn nay as ky awnt say bhtr nhyn paya۔ as nay kha: asay khryd kr day dw، kywnkh tm myn say sb say bhtr why hay jw qrz ka bhtr ada krnay wala hw\n\njamaِ trmzy، hdys: | arby hdys:"
"1326","Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat kiya:\n\nRasoolullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ek khareed ke dher ke paas se guzaray. Aap (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne usmein haath daala aur unki ungliyan gili hui. Aap (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Ae khareed ke maalike"
"1327","Abu Hurairah (rzy allh anh) rwayt krthyn kh rswl allh (ﷺ) nay frmaya: \bht allh bya myn brdasht w thml dwst rkhta hay۔\"""""""
"1328","Jabir (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Allah Ta'ala ne ek aadmi ko jo tum se pehle tha"
"1329","Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) se marwi hai ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Jab tum Masjid mein kisi ko khareed o farokhte dekho to kaho: 'Allah tujhe tere karobaar mein nafa na de.' Aur jab tum Masjid mein kisi ko kisi gum cheez ki elaan karte dekho to kaho: 'Allah tujhe woh cheez wapas na karay.'\"" Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) ki hadith Hasan Gharib hai. Ahle ilm mein se baaz is par amal karte hain. Woh Masjid mein khareed o farokht na pasand karte hain. Yeh Ahmad aur Ishaq (رحمهما"""""
"1330","Anas bin Malik (radiyAllahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallAllahu Alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Jo shakhs qazi ki mansab ke liye maange"
"1331","Abu Kurayb ne hum se rivayat kiya, Ishaq ibn Sulayman al-Razi ne hum se rivayat kiya, Mughirah ibn Muslim ne Yunus se, Hasan se, Abu Hurayrah se, ke Rasoolullah ﷺ ne farmaya: ""Allah us shaks ko pasand farmata hai jo bechne mein saahil (aasan) ho, khareedne mein saahil ho, aur faisla karne (qaza) mein bhi saahil ho."" Usne kaha: Is baab mein Jabir se bhi riwayat hai. Abu Isa ne farmaya: Ye hadith gharib hai. Aur baaz logon ne ye hadith Yunus se Saeed al-Maqburi se Abu Hurayrah se rivayat kiya hai."
"1332","Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \n\Jis shakhs qazi ka zimmedari apne sar le le"
"1333","Al-Hasan ibn Ali al-Khallal ne hum se rivayat kiya, Arim ne hum se rivayat kiya, Abdul Aziz ibn Muhammad ne hume khabar di, Yazid ibn Khusayfah ne Muhammad ibn Abdur Rahman ibn Thawban se, Abu Hurayrah se, ke Rasoolullah ﷺ ne farmaya: ""Jab tum kisi ko masjid mein bechte ya khareedte dekho to kaho: 'Allah teri tijarat ko na barkat de.' Aur jab kisi ko masjid mein gumshuda cheez pukarte dekho to kaho: 'Allah usay tum par wapas na karde.'"" Abu Isa ne farmaya: Abu Hurayrah ka ye hadith hasan gharib hai. Aur baaz ahl-e-ilm is par amal karte hain, woh masjid mein bechna-kharidna karahate the. Ye Ahmad aur Ishaq ka qaul hai. Aur baaz ahl-e-ilm ne masjid mein bechna-kharidna jaiz qarar diya hai."
"1334","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney naap tol walon sey farmaya : '' tumharey do aisey kaam padhi. kiye gaey hain jis main tum sey pehley ki ummaten halak ho gaeen '' padhi. . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : hum is hadees ko sirf ba-riwayat Husain bin Qais marfoo jantey hain, aur Husain bin Qais hadees mein zaeef gardaney jatey hain. neez ye sahih sanad sey ibne-Abbas sey moqufan marvi hai."
"1335","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney eik taat jo kajaawe key nichey bichhaya jata hai aur eik piyala bechaa, aap ney farmaya : ''ye taat aur piyala kon khareedeyga? eik aadmi ney arz kiya : main inhen eik dirham mein ley sakta hun.'' , Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''eik dirham sey ziyada kon dega?'' to eik aadmi ney aap ko do dirham diye, to aap ney usi key haath sey ye dono cheezen bech den. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan hai. hum isey sirf Akhzar bin Ajlan ki riwayat sey jantey hain. 2- aur Abdullah Hanfi hi jinhoney Anas sey riwayat ki hai abu-Bakar Hanfi hain. 3- baaz ehle-ilm ka isi par amal hai. ye log ghanimat aur meeras key saman ko ziyada qeemat deney waley sey bechney mein koi harj nahin samajhtey hain. 4- ye hadees Moa'tamir bin Suleman (Alaihissalam) aur doosrey kaee badey logon ney bhi Akhzar bin Ajlan sey riwayat ki hai."
"1336","Ansaar key eik shakhs ney padhi. apney ghulam ko mudabbir padhi. bana diya (yani us sey ye keh diya ke tum merey marney key baad azad ho), phir wo mar gaya, aur us ghulam key ilawa usney koi aur maal nahin chhoda. to Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney isey bech diya padhi. aur Naeem bin Abdullah bin Nahaam ney isey kharida. Jabir kehtey hain : wo eik qibti ghulam tha. Abdullah bin Zuber Raziallahu anhuma ki amaarat key pehley saal wo faut huwa. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- ye Jabir bin Abdullah sey aur bhi sanadon sey marvi hai. padhi. 3- Sahaba kiram waghaira mein sey baaz ehle-ilm ka isi par amal hai. ye log mudabbir ghulam ko bechney mein koi harj nahin samajhtey hain. yehi Shafai , Ahmed aur Is-haq bin Raahviya ka bhi qol hai. 4- aur Sahaba kiram waghaira mein sey baaz ehle-ilm ney mudabbir ki bai (saude) ko makrooh jana hai. ye Sufiyan Sory , Malik aur Auzaai ka qol hai."
"1337","Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney maal bechney walon sey bazar mein pahunchney sey pehley ja kar milney sey mana farmaya hai. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : is baab mein Ali , ibne-Abbas , Abu-Hurera , abu Saeed Khudri , ibne-Umar , aur eik aur Sahabi (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi hadeesen aai hain."
"1338","Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney bahar sey aaney waley samanon ko bazar mein pahunchney sey pehley aagey ja kar kharid leney sey mana farmaya : agar kisi aadmi ney mil kar kharid liya to sahibe maal ko jab wo bazar mein pahunchey to ikhtiyar hai (chahey to wo bechey chahey to na bechey). Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Ayub ki riwayat sey Hasan gharib hai. 2- ibne-Masood ki hadees Hasan sahih hai. ehle-ilm ki eik jamaat ney maal bechney walon sey bazar mein pahunchney sey pehley mil kar maal kharidney ko najaaiz kaha hai ye dhokey ki eik qism hai hamarey as-haab (saathiyon) mein sey Shafai waghera ka yehi qol hai."
"1339","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''shehri bahar sey aaney waley dehati ka maal na bechey padhi. (balke dehati ko khud bechney dey).'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : is baab mein Talha , Jabir , Anas , ibne-Abbas ,Abu Yazeed Kasir bin Abdullah key dada Amr bin Auf Muzni aur eik aur Sahaba (Raziallahu anhu) sey bhi hadeesen aai hain."
"1340","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''koi shehri kisi gaaon waley ka saman na farokht karey, tum logon ko (unka saman khud bechney key liye) chhod do. Allah Taala baaz ko baaz key zariey rizq deta hai.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Abu-Hurera ki hadees Hasan sahih hai. padhi. 2- is bab mein Jabir ki hadees bhi Hasan sahih hai. padhi. 3- Sahaba kiram mein sey baaz ehle-ilm ka isi hadees par amal hai. un logon ney makrooh samjha hai ke shahri bahar sey aaney waley dehati ka saman bechey. 4- aur baaz logon ney rukhsat di hai ke shahri dehati key liye saman kharid sakta hai. 5- Shafai kehtey hain ke shahri ka dehati key saman ko bechna makrooh hai aur agar wo bech dey to bai (sauda) jayez hoga."
"1341","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney muhaaqla aur mazaabna sey mana farmaya hai. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- is bab mein ibne-Umar , ibne-Abbas , Zaid bin Sabit , Saad , Jabir , Raafey bin khadij aur abu-Saeed (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi hadeesen aai hain. 3- baaliyon mein khadi kheti ko gehun sey bechney ko muhaaqla kehtey hain, aur darkht par lagi hui khajoor todi gaee khajoor sey bechney ko mazaabna kehtey hain. 4- aksar ehle-ilm ka isi par amal hai. ye log muhaaqla aur mazaabna ko makrooh samajhtey hain."
"1342","Abu Ayaaz Zaid ney Saad (Raziallahu anhu) sey gehun ko chhilka utarey huye jau sey bechney key barey mein puchha to unhoney puchha : in dono mein kon afzal hai? unhoney kaha : gehun, to unhoney is sey mana farmaya. aur Saad (Raziallahu anhu) ney bayan kiya ke mainey Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey suna aap sey tar khajoor sey khushk khajoor kharidney ka masla puchha ja raha tha. to aap ney qarib bethey logon sey puchha : ''kya tar khajoor khushk honey par kam ho jaeyga?'' logon ney kaha haan (kam ho jaeyga), to aap ney is sey mana farmaya. Muallif ney basanad (Wakee an Maalik) isi tarah ki hadees bayan ki. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- ehle-ilm ka isi par amal hai, aur yehi Shafai aur hamarey (saathiyon) ka bhi qol hai."
"1343","Rasoolullah ney khajoor key darkht ki bai (saude) sey mana farmaya hai yahan tak ke wo khush rang ho jaey (pukhtagi ko pahunch jaey)."
"1344","Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney (gehun aur jau waghera key) khoshey bechney sey mana farmaya yahan tak ke wo pukhta ho jaeyn aur aafat sey maamoon ho jaeyn, aap ney kharidar aur bechnewale dono ko mana farmaya hai. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ibne-Umar Raziallahu anhuma ki hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- is bab mein Anas , Aaisha , Abu-Hurera , ibne-Abbas , Jabir , abu Saeed Khudri aur Zaid bin Sabit (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi hadeesen aai hain. 3- Sahaba kiram mein sey ehle-ilm ka isi par amal hai. ye log phal ki pukhtagi zahir honey sey pehley uskey bechney ko makrooh samajhtey hain, yehi Shafai , Ahmed aur Is-haq bin Raahviya ka bhi qol hai."
"1345","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney angoor ko bechney sey mana farmaya hai yahan tak ke wo siyah (pukhta) ho jaey. aur daney (ghalley) ko bechney sey mana farmaya hai yahan tak ke wo sakht ho jaey. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan gharib hai. hum isey sirf ba-riwayat Hammad bin Salma hi marfoo jantey hain."
"1346","Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney hamal key hamal ko bechney sey mana farmaya. Imam Tirmizi kehtey : 1- ibne-Umar Raziallahu anhuma ki hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- Shoba ney is hadees ko ba-tareeq : (an Ayoob an Saeed bin Juber an ibne-Abbas) riwayat kiya hai. aur Abdul Wahab Saqafi waghera ney ba-tareeq : (an Ayoob an Saeed bin Jubair w Naafe an ibne-Umar an Nabi Sallallahu Alehi wasallam) riwayat ki hai. aur ye ziyada sahih hai. 3- ehle-ilm ka isi par amal hai. ( حبل الحبلة) (hamal key hamal) sey murad oontni key bachchey ka bachcha hai. ehle-ilm key nazdik ye bai mansookh hai aur ye dhoke ki bai (saude) mein sey eik bai (sauda) hai. 4- is bab mein Abdullah bin Abbas aur abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi hadeesen aai hain."
"1347","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney gharar ke saude aur hasat ke saude sey mana farmaya hai. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- is bab mein ibne-Umar , ibne-Abbas , abu-Saeed aur Anas (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi hadeesen aai hain. 3- ehle-ilm ka isi hadees par amal hai, wo gharar ke saude ko makrooh samajhtey hain. 4- Shafai kehtey hain : machhli ki bai jo pani mein ho, bhagey huye ghulam ki bai , aasman mein udtey parindon ki bai aur isi tarah ki dusri bai (saude), gharar ke saude ki qism mein sey hain. 5- aur hasat ke saude sey murad ye hai ke bechney wala kharidney waley sey ye kahey ke jab main teri taraf kankari phenk dun to merey aur terey darmiyan mein bai (sauda) wajib ho gaee. ye sauda munaabiza key jaisa hai. aur ye jahiliyat ki bai (saude) ki qismon mein sey eik qisam thi."
"1348","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney eik bai (saude) mein do bai (saude) karney sey mana farmaya. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- is bab mein Abdullah bin Amr , ibne-Umar aur ibne-Masood (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi hadeesen aai hain. 3- ehle-ilm ka isi par amal hai. 4- baaz ehle-ilm ney eik bai (saude) mein do bai (saude) ki tafseer yun ki hai ke eik bai (saude) mein do bai (saude) ye hai ke maslan kahey : main tumhen ye kapda naqad das rupey mein aur udhaar bees rupey mein bechtaa hun aur bechnewala dono baia'oon (saudon) mein sey kisi eik par juda na ho, (balke baghair kisi eik ki saude key tai kiye hue hi wahan sey chala jaaey) jab wo un dono mein sey kisi eik par juda ho to koi harj nahin ba-sharte-ke un dono mein sey kisi eik par bai (sauda) tey ho gaya ho. 5- Shafai kehtey hain : eik bai (saude) mein do bai (saude) ka mafhoom ye hai ke koi kahey : main apna ye ghar itney rupey mein is shart par bech raha hun ke tum apna ghulam mujh sey itney rupey mein bech do. jab tera ghulam merey liye wajib aur sabit ho jaeyga to mera ghar terey liye wajib aur Sabit ho jaeyga. ye bai (sauda) baghair qeemat tey hona hua. aur kharidar aur bechnewale mein sey koi nahin janta ke uska soda kis chiz par tei huwa hai."
"1349","Maine Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key paas aa kar arz kiya : merey paas kuch log aatey hain aur us chiz ko bechney key liye kehtey hain jo merey paas nahin hoti, to kya main us chiz ko unkey liye bazar sey kharid kar laaun phir farokht karun? aap ney farmaya : '' jo chiz tumharey paas nahin hai uski bai (sauda) na karo.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai, hukm 1234 mein aa raha hai. 2- is bab mein Abdullah bin umr Raziallahu anhuma sey bhi riwayat hai,"
"1350","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney mujhey us chiz key bechney sey mana farmaya jo merey paas na ho. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan hai. 2- Is-haq bin Mansoor kehtey hain : mainey Ahmed bin Hanbal sey puchha : bai (saude) key sath qarz sey mana farmaney ka kya mafhoom hai? unhoney kaha : uski surat ye hai ke aadmi ko qarz dey phir us sey bai (sauda) karey aur saman ki qeemat ziyada ley aur ye bhi ehtimaal (gumaan) hai ke koi kisi sey kisi chiz ke liye peshgi ki raqam de aur kahey : agar terey paas rupya faraham nahin ho saka to tujhey ye saman merey haath bech dena hoga. Is-haq (ibne Raahwiya) ney bhi wohi baat kahi hai jo Ahmed ney kahi hai. 3- Is-haq bin Mansoor ney kaha : mainey Ahmed sey aisi chiz ki bai (saude) key barey mein puchha jis par kharidar zaamin nahin to unhoney jawab diya, (ye mumaaniat) merey nazdik sirf tuaam (khaane) ki bai (saude) key sath hai jab tak ki kharidar ka us cheez par ikhtiyaar na ho, Is-haq bin Raahviya ney bhi wohi baat kahi hai jo Ahmed ney kahi hai lekin ye mumaaniat har us chiz mein hai jo naapi ya tauli jati ho. Ahmed bin Hanbal kehtey hain : jab  vikreta ye kahey : main aap sey ye kapda is shart key sath bech raha hun ke iski silaaii aur dhulaae merey zimme hai. to bai (saude) ki ye shakal eik bai (saude) mein do shart key qism sey hai. aur jab vikreta ye kahey : main ye kapda aap ko is shart key sath bech raha hun ke iski silaai merey zimme hai. ya vikreta ye kahey : main ye kapda aap ko is shart key sath bech raha hun ke iski dhulaae merey zimme hai, to is bai (saude) mein koi muzaaeqa (harj) nahin hai, ye eik hi shart hai. Is-haq bin Raahviya ney bhi wohi baat kahi hai jo Ahmed ney kahi hai."
"1351","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : bai (saude) key sath qarz jayez nahin hai, aur na eik bai (saude) mein do shartein jayez hain padhi. aur na aisi chiz sey faeyda uthana jayez hai jis ka wo zaamin na ho padhi. aur na aisi chiz ki bai jayez hai jo tumharey paas na ho. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- Hakim bin Hizaam ki hadees Hasan hai (1232, 1233), ye un sey aur bhi sanadon sey marvi hai. aur Ayub Sakhtiyaan aur Abu-Bashar ney isey Yusuf bin Maahik sey aur Yusuf ney Hakim bin Hizaam sey riwayat kiya hai. aur Auf aur Hisham bin Hassan ney is hadees ko ibne Sirin sey aur ibne Sirin ney Hakim bin Hizaam sey aur Hakim bin Hizaam ney Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey riwayat kiya hai aur ye hadees (riwayat) mursal (munqata') hai. isey (asal mein) ibne Sirin ney Ayub Sakhtiyaan sey aur Ayub ney Yusuf bin Maahik sey aur Yusuf bin Maahik ney Hakim bin Hizaam sey isi tarah riwayat kiya hai."
"1352","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney mujhey us chiz key bechney sey mana farmaya hai jo merey paas nahin hai. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Wakee ney is hadees ko ba-tareeq : (an Yazeed bin Ibraheem an ibne-Sirin an Ayoob an Hakeem bin Hizaam) riwayat kiya hai aur is mein Yusuf bin Maahik key wastey ka zikr nahin kiya hai. Abdus-Samad ki riwayat ziyada sahih hai (jis mein ibne Sirin ka zikr hai). aur Yahya bin abi Kasir ney ye hadees ba-tareeq : (an Yaa'li bin Hakeem an Yousuf bin Maahik an Abdullah bin Asma an Hakeem bin Hizaam an Nabi Sallallahu Alehi wasallam) riwayat kiya hai. 2- aksar ehle-ilm ka usi hadees par amal hai, ye log us chiz ki bai (saude) ko makrooh samajhtey hain jo aadmi key paas na ho."
"1353","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney wala (meeras) ko bechney aur hiba (hadiya) karney sey mana farmaya. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- hum isey sirf ba-riwayat Abdullah bin Dinar jantey hain jisey unhoney ibne-Umar sey riwayat ki hai. 3- Yahya bin saleem ney ye hadees b-tareeq : (Abdullah bin umr an Nafey an ibne-Umar an Nabi Sallallahu Alehi wasallam) riwayat ki hai ke aap ney wala (meeras) ko bechney aur hiba karney sey mana farmaya. is sanad mein weham hai. iskey andar Yahya bin Saleem sey weham huwa hai. 4- Abdul Wahab saqafi, aur Abdullah bin Numer aur deegar kaee logon ney ba-tareeq : (an Abdullah bin umr an Abdullah bin Dinar an ibne-Umar an Nabi Sallallahu Alehi wasallam) riwayat ki hai aur ye Yahya bin Saleem ki hadees sey ziyada sahih hai. 5- ehle-ilm ka isi hadees par amal hai."
"1354","Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney janwer ko janwer sey udhaar bechney sey mana farmaya hai. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Samura (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- Hasan ka samaa (sun'na), Samra sey sahih hai. Ali bin Madini waghera ney aisa hi kaha hai. 3- is bab mein ibne-Abbas, Jabir aur ibne-Umar (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi hadeesen aai hain. 4- Sahaba kiram waghaira mein sey aksar ehle-ilm ka janwer ko janwer sey udhaar bechney key masle mein isi hadees par amal hai. Sufiyan Sory aur ehle-koofa ka yehi qol hai. Ahmed bhi isi key qaail hain. 5- Sahaba kiram waghaira mein sey baaz ehle-ilm ney janwer key janwer sey udhaar bechney ki ijazat di hai. aur yehi Shafai , aur Is-haq bin Raahviya ka bhi qol hai."
"1355","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''do janwaron ko eik janwar sey udhaar bechnaa durust nahin hai, haathon haath (naqad) bechney mein koi harj nahin hai.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"1356","eik ghulam aaya aur usney Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey hijrat par baiat ki, Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam nahin jaan sakey ke ye ghulam hai. itney mein uska Malik aa gaya wo us ko maang raha tha, Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney us sey kaha : tum isey mujh sey bech do, chunanche aap ney isey do kaley ghulamon key iwaz kharid liya, phir iskey baad aap kisi sey us waqt tak baiat nahin letey they jab tak ke us sey daryaft na kar letey ke kya wo ghulam hai? Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- is bab mein Anas (Raziallahu anhu) sey bhi riwayat hai, 3- ehle-ilm ka isi hadees par amal hai ke eik ghulam ko do ghulam sey naqada-naqad kharidney mein koi harj nahin hai aur jab udhaar ho to is mein ikhtilaf hai."
"1357","Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''soney ko soney sey , chaandi ko chaandi sey , khajoor ko khajoor sey , gehun ko gehun sey , namak ko namak sey aur jau ko jau sey barabar barabar becho , jisney ziyada diya ya ziyada liya usney sood ka maamla kiya. soney ko chaandi sey naqda-naqad, jaisey chaho becho , gehun ko khajoor sey naqadan jaisey chaho becho , aur jau ko khajoor sey naqadan jaisey chaho becho.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Ubada (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- baaz logon ney is hadees ko Khalid sey isi sanad sey riwayat kiya hai is mein ye hai ke gehun ko jau sey naqda-naqad jaisey chaho becho. 3- baaz logon ney is hadees ko Khalid sey aur Khalid ney Abu-Qulaba sey aur Abu-Qulaba ney Abul Ash'as sey aur Abul Ash'as ney Ubada sey aur Ubada ney Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey riwayat kiya hai aur is mein ye izafa kiya hai : Khalid kehtey hain : Abu-Qulaba ney kaha : gehun ko jau sey jaisey chaho becho. phir unhoney puri hadees zikr ki. 4- is bab mein abu-Saeed, Abu-Hurera , Bilal aur Anas (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi hadeesen aai hain. 5- ehle-ilm ka isi par amal hai, wo log gehun ko gehun sey aur jau ko jau sey sirf barabar barabar hi bechney ko jayez samajhtey hain aur jab ajnaas mukhtalif ho jaeyn to kami , beshi key sath bechney mein koi harj nahin ba-sharte-ke bai naqad ho. Sahaba kiram waghaira mein sey ehle-ilm ka yehi qol hai. Sufiyan Sory , Shafai , Ahmed aur Is-haq bin Raahviya ka bhi yehi qol hai. Shafai kehtey hain : iski daleel Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ka ye farman hai ke jau ko gehun sey naqda naqad jaisey chaho becho. 6- ehle-ilm ki eik jamaat ney jau sey bhi gehun key bechney ko makrooh samjha hai, siwaye iske ke wazan mein masaawi (barabar) hon, pehla qol hi ziyada sahih hai."
"1358","Main aur ibne-Umar dono abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallauh anhum) key paas aaye to unhoney hum sey bayan kiya ke Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : (isey merey dono kanon ney aap sey suna) : ''soney ko soney sey barabar barabar hi becho aur chaandi ko chaandi sey barabar barabar hi becho. eik ko doosrey sey kam aur ziyada na kiya jaey aur ghair mojud ko mojud sey na bech.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- iskey silsiley mein abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadees jisey unhoney Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey riwayat ki hai Hasan sahih hai. 2- is bab mein abu-Bakar , umr , Usman , Abu-Hurera , Hisham bin Aamir , Bara , Zaid bin Arqam , Fazala bin Ubaid , abu-Bakra , ibne-Umar , Abu-Darda aur Bilal (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi hadeesen aai hain. 3- Sahaba kiram waghaira mein sey ehle-ilm ka isi par amal hai. 4- magar wo jo ibne-Abbas Raziallahu anhuma sey marvi (riwayat hui) hai ke wo soney ko soney sey aur chaandi ko chaandi sey kami beshi key sath bechney mein koi muzaaeqa nahin samajhtey they, jabke bai (sauda) naqad ho, aur wo ye bhi kehtey they ke sood to udhaar bechney mein hai aur aisa hi kuchh in key baaz as-haab (saathiyon) sey bhi marvi (riwayat hui) hai. 5- aur ibne-Abbas sey ye bhi marvi (riwayat hui) hai ke abu Saeed Khudri ney jab un sey Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ki hadees bayan ki to unhoney apney qol sey ruju kar liya, pehla qol ziyada sahih hai. ehle-ilm ka isi par amal hai. aur yehi Sufiyan Sory , ibne-Mubarak , Shafai , Ahmed aur Is-haq bin Raahviya ka bhi qol hai, aur ibne-Mubarak kehtey hain : sarf (soney chaandi ko soney chaandi ke badle bechne)  mein ikhtilaf nahin hai."
"1359","Main Baqee key bazar mein oont bechaa karta tha, main dinaaron sey bechtaa tha, uskey badley chaandi leta tha, aur chaandi sey bechtaa tha aur uskey badley Dinar leta tha, main Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key paas aaya aur mainey aap ko dekha ke aap Hafsa (Raziallahu Anha) key ghar sey nikal rahey hain to mainey aap sey iskey barey mein puchha aap ney farmaya : ''qeemat key sath aisa karney mein koi muzaaeqa (harj) nahin hai.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- hum is hadees ko sirf Simaak bin Harab hi ki riwayat sey marfoo jantey hain. 2- Simaak ney isey Saeed bin Juber sey aur Saeed ney ibne-Umar sey riwayat ki hai aur Dawud bin Abi Hindiya ney ye hadees Saeed bin Juber sey aur Saeed ney ibne-Umar sey moqufan riwayat ki hai. 3- baaz ehle-ilm ka amal isi hadees par hai ke agar koi soney key badley chaandi ley ya chaandi key badley sona ley , to koi harj nahin hai. yehi Ahmed aur Is-haq ka bhi qol hai. 4- aur Sahaba kiram waghaira mein sey baaz ehle-ilm ney isey makrooh jana hai."
"1360","Main (baazaar mein) ye kehtey huye aaya : dirahmon ko (deenar waghera sey) kon badleyga? to Talha bin Ubedullah (Raziallahu anhu) ney kaha aur wo umr bin Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) key paas they : hamein apna sona dikhaao, aur jab hamara khaadim aa jaey to hamarey paas aa jaao hum (iskey badley) tumhen chaandi dey den gey. (ye sun kar) umr (Raziallahu anhu) ney kaha : Allah ki qism ! aisa hergiz nahin ho sakta tum isey chaandi hi do warna is ka sona hi lota do, isliye ke Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya hai : ''soney key badley chaandi lena sood hai, siwaaye iske ke eik haath sey do, doosrey haath sey lo, gehun key badley gehun lena sood hai, siwaaye iske ke eik haath sey do , doosrey haath sey lo , jau key badley jau lena sood hai siwaaye iske ke eik haath sey do , doosrey haath sey lo , aur khajoor key badley khajoor lena sood hai siwaaye iske ke eik haath sey do , doosrey haath sey l.o'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- ehle-ilm ka isi par amal hai. « إلاھاء"
"1361","Mainey Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ko farmatey suna : '' jisney «تأبیر» padhi. (pewand kaari) key baad khajoor ka darkht kharid to uska phal bechney waley hi ka hoga siwaaye iske ke kharidney wala (khareedtey waqt phal ki) shart laga ley. aur jisney koi aisa ghulam kharid jis key paas maal ho to uska maal bechney waley hi ka hoga siwaaye iske ke kharidney wala ( khareedtey waqt maal ki) shart laga ley.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ibne-Umar Raziallahu anhuma ki hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- isi tarah aur bhi turq sey basanad (an Zohri an Salim an ibne-Umar an Nabi Sallallahu Alehi wasallam) sey riwayat hai aap ney farmaya : ''jisney pewand-kaari key baad khajoor ka darkht kharid to uska phal bechney waley hi ka hoga siwaaye iske ke kharidney wala ( darkht key sath phal ki bhi) shart laga ley aur jisney koi aisa ghulam kharid jis key paas maal ho to uska maal bechney waley ka hoga siwaaye iske ke kharidney wala ( ghulam key sath maal ki bhi) shart laga ley.''  3- ye Nafey sey bhi marvi (riwayat hui) hai unhoney ibne-Umar sey aur ibne-Umar ney Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey riwayat ki hai ke aap ney farmaya : ''jisney khajoor ka koi darkht kharid jiski pewand-kaari ki ja chuki ho to uska phal bechney waley hi ka hoga siwaaye iske ke kharidney wala ( darkht key sath phal ki bhi) shart laga ley.''  4- Nafey sey marvi (riwayat hui) hai wo ibne-Umar sey riwayat kartey hain, wo kehtey hain ke jisney koi ghulam bechaa jis key paas maal ho to uska maal bechney waley hi ka hoga siwaaye iske ke kharidney wala (ghulam key sath maal ki bhi) shart laga ley. 5- isi tarah Ubedullah bin umr waghera ney Nafey sey dono hadisein riwayat ki hain. 6- neez (isi ke saath) baaz logon ney ye hadees Nafey sey , Nafey ney ibne-Umar sey aur unhoney Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey riwayat ki hai. 7- Ikrima bin Khalid ney ibne-Umar sey ibne-Umar ney Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey Salim ki hadees ki tarah riwayat ki hai. 8- Muhammad bin Ismail Bukhari kehtey hain ke Zohri ki hadees jisey unhoney b-tareeq : (an Salim an Abeeh an Nabi Sallallahu Alehi wasallam) riwayat ki hai is baab mein sab sey ziyada sahih hai. 9- baaz ehle-ilm ka isi hadees par amal hai. aur yehi Shafai , Ahmed aur Is-haq bin Raahviya ka bhi qol hai. 10- is bab mein Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) sey bhi riwayat hai."
"1362","Mainey Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ko farmatey suna : ''bechney wala aur kharidney wala dono ko jab tak wo juda na hon bai (saude) ko baqi rakhney aur fasakh (radd) karney ka ikhtiyar hai padhi. ya wo dono ikhtiyar ki shart kar lein.''  Nafey kehtey hain : jab ibne-Umar Raziallahu anhuma koi chiz khareedtey aur bethey hotey to khadey ho jatey taake bai (sauda) wajib (pakka) ho jaey (aur ikhtiyar baqi na rahey). Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ibne-Umar Raziallahu anhuma ki hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- is bab mein abu-Barza , Hakim bin Hizaam, Abdullah bin Abbas , Abdullah bin Amr , Samura aur Abu-Hurera (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi hadeesen aai hain. 3- Sahaba kiram waghaira mein sey baaz ehle-ilm ka isi par amal hai. aur yehi Shafai , Ahmed aur Is-haq bin Raahviya ka bhi qol hai. ye log kehtey hain ke تفرق sey murad jismani judai hai na ke qauli judai, yani majlis sey judai murad hai guftgu ka mauzoo badalna murad nahin. 4- aur baaz ehle-ilm kehtey hain ke Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key qol «مالم يتفرقا» sey murad qauli judai hai, pehla qol ziyada sahih hai, isliye ke ibne-Umar Raziallahu anhuma ney hi is ko Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey riwayat kiya hai. aur wo apni riwayat karda hadees ka maana ziyada jantey hain aur un sey marvi (riwayat hui) hai ke jab wo bai wajib ( pakki ( karney ka irada kartey to (majlis sey uth kar) chal detey taake bai wajib ho jaey. 5- abu-Barza (Raziallahu anhu) sey bhi isi tarah marvi (riwayat hui) hai."
"1363","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''بائع ( bechney wala (aur mushtari (kharidney wala) ( kharidar ( jab tak juda na hon padhi. dono ko bai (saude) key baqi rakhney aur fasakh (radd) kar deney ka ikhtiyar hai, agar wo dono sach kahin aur saaman ki khoobi aur kharabi wazeh kar den to un ki bai (saude) mein barkat di jaeygi aur agar un dono ney aeb ko chupaya aur jhooti baaten kahin to un ki bai (saude) ki barkat khatam kar di jaeygi. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees sahih hai. 2- isi tarah abu-Barza Aslami sey bhi marvi (riwayat hui) hai ke do aadmi eik ghodey ki bai (sauda) kerney key baad uska muqadma ley kar unkey paas aaye, wo log eik kashti mein they. abu-Barza ney kaha : main nahin samajhta ke tum dono juda huye ho aur Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya hai : '' bechne wala aur kharidar jab tak (majlis sey) juda na hon ikhtiyar hai.''  3- ehle-koofa waghaira mein sey baaz ehle-ilm is taraf gaey hain ke judai qol sey hogi , yehi Sufiyan Sory ka qol hai, aur isi tarah Malik bin Anas sey bhi marvi (riwayat hui) hai. 4- aur ibne-Mubarak ka kehna hai ke main is maslak ko kaisey radd kar dun? jabke Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey waarid hadees sahih hai. 5- aur unhoney is ko qawi kaha hai. Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key qol « إلا بيع الخيار » ka matlab ye hai ke kharidar bechne wale ko bai (saude/sauda) key wajib karney key baad ikhtiyar dedey , phir jab bechne wala bai (saude/sauda) ko ikhtiyar kar ley to uskey baad us ko bai (saude/sauda) fasakh (radd) karney ka ikhtiyar nahin hoga, agar-che wo dono juda na huye hun. isi tarah Shafai waghera ney iski tafseer ki hai. 6- aur jo log jismani judai (تفرق"
"1364","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''بائع ( bechney wala (aur مشتری ( kharidar )  jab tak juda na hon in ko ikhtiyar hai siwaye iske ke bai (sauda)  khiyaar ho (tab juda honey key baad bhi wapsi ka ikhtiyar baqi rehta hai), aur بائع (bechney wale)  key liye jayez nahin hai ke apney sathi (kharidar) sey us dar sey juda ho jaey ke wo bai (saude) ko fasakh (radd) kar dega.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan hai. 2- aur is ka maana yehi hai ke bai (saude) key baad wo kharidar sey juda ho jaey is dar sey ke wo isey fasakh (radd) kar dega aur agar judai sirf kalam sey ho jati, aur bai (saude) key baad kharidar ko ikhtiyar na hota to is hadees ka koi maana na hoga jo ke aap ney farmaya hai : ''"
"1365","Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''baaey (bechney wala) aur mushtari (kharidney wala) bai (saude) (ki majlis) sey raza-mandi key sath hi juda hon.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees gharib hai."
"1366","Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney bai (saude) key baad eik Erabi (dehati) (dehaati) ko ikhtiyar diya. ye hadees Hasan gharib hai."
"1367","Eik aadmi kharid aur farokht karney mein boda padhi. tha aur wo (aksar) kharid aur farokht karta tha, uskey ghar waley Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key paas aaye aur un logon ney arz kiya : Allah key Rasool ! aap is ko (kharid aur farokht sey) rok dijiye, to Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney us ko bulwaya aur usey us sey mana farma diya. usney arz kiya : Allah key Rasool ! main bai (saude) sey baaz rehney par sabr nahin kar sakoonga, aap ney farmaya : ''(achchha) jab tum bai (sauda) karo to ye keh liya karo ke eik haath sey do aur doosrey haath sey lo aur koi dhoka-dhadi nahin.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Anas ki hadees Hasan sahih gharib hai. 2- is bab mein ibne-Umar Raziallahu anhuma sey bhi riwayat hai, 3- baaz ehle-ilm ka isi hadees par amal hai, wo kehtey hain ke azad shakhs ko kharid aur farokht sey us waqt roka ja sakta hai jab wo kamzor aql ka ho, yehi Ahmed aur Is-haq bin Raahviya ka bhi qol hai. 4- aur baaz log azad baligh ko bai (saude) sey rokney ko durust nahin samajhtey hain."
"1368","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''jisney koi aisa janwer kharid jis ka doodh than mein (kaee dino sey) rok diya gaya ho, to jab wo uska doodh dohai to usey ikhtiyar hai agar wo chahey to eik saa khajoor key sath us ko wapis kar dey.''  Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : is baab mein Anas aur eik aur Sahaba sey bhi riwayat hai,"
"1369","Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''jisney koi aisa janwer kharid jiska doodh than mein rok diya gaya ho to usey teen din tak ikhtiyar hai. agar wo usey wapis karey to uskey sath eik saa koi ghalla bhi wapis karey jo gehun na ho.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- hamarey as-haab (saathiyon) ka isi par amal hai. in hi mein Shafai, Ahmed aur Is-haq bin Raahviya hain. aap key qol (لاسمراء) ka matlab ("
"1370","Unhoney (raastey mein) Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey eik oont bechaa aur apney ghar walon tak sawar ho kar janey ki shart rakhi lagai. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- ye aur bhi sanadon sey Jabir sey marvi hai. 3- Sahaba kiram waghaira mein sey baaz ehle-ilm ka isi par amal hai. ye log bai (saude) mein shart ko jayez samajhtey hain jab shart eik ho. yehi qol Ahmed aur Is-haq bin Raahviya ka hai. 4- aur baaz ehle-ilm kehtey hain ke bai (saude) mein shart jayez nahin hai aur jab is mein shart ho to bai (sauda) puri nahin hogi."
"1371","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''sawari ka janwer jab rehan rakha ho to is par sawari ki jaey aur doodh wala janwer jab girwi rakha ho to uska doodh piya jaey, aur jo sawari karey aur doodh piye janwer ka kharch usi key zimme hai.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- hum isey ba-riwayat Aamir Shaa'bi hi marfoo jantey hain, unhoney Abu-Hurera sey riwayat ki hai aur kaee logon ney is hadees ko Aamash sey riwayat kiya hai aur Aamash ney abu-Saaleh sey aur abu-Saaleh ney Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey mauqufan riwayat ki hai. 3- baaz ehle-ilm ka isi hadees par amal hai. aur yehi qol Ahmed aur Is-haq bin Raahviya ka bhi hai. 4- baaz ehle-ilm kehtey hain ke rehan sey kisi tarah ka faeyda uthana durust nahin hai."
"1372","Mainey khaibar key din baara Dinar main eik haar kharid , jis mein soney aur jawaharat jadey huye they, mainey unhen (tod-kar) juda-juda kiya to mujhey is mein baara Dinar sey ziyada miley. mainey Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey uska zikr kya to aap ney farmaya : ''(soney aur jawaharat jadey huye haar) na bechey jaeyn jab tak unhen juda juda na kar liya jaey.'' isi tarah Muallif ney Quteba sey isi sanad sey hadees riwayat ki hai. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- Sahaba kiram waghaira mein sey baaz ehle-ilm ka isi par amal hai. ye log chaandi jadi hui talwaar ya kamar band ya isi jaisi doosriy chizon ko dirham sey farokht karna durust nahin samajhtey hain, jab tak ke un sey chaandi alag na kar li jaey. ibne-Mubarak , Shafai , Ahmed aur Is-haq bin Raahviya ka bhi yehi qol hai. 3- aur Sahaba kiram waghaira mein sey baaz ehle-ilm ney iski ijazat di hai."
"1373","Unhoney Barira (laundi) ko khareednaa chaha, to Bareera key malikon ney walaa ki shart lagai to Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney Aaisha sey farmaya : '' tum usey kharid lo, (aur azad kar do) isliye ke walaa to usi ka hoga jo qeemat ada karey, ya jo nemat (azad karney) ka Malik ho.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Aaisha (Raziallahu Anha) ki hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- is bab mein ibne-Umar Raziallahu anhuma sey bhi hadeesen marvi (riwayat hui) hai. 3- ehle-ilm ka isi par amal hai."
"1374","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney unhen eik Dinar mein qurbani ka janwer kharidney key liye bheja , to unhoney qurbani ka eik janwer kharid (phir usey do Dinar mein bech diya), is mein unhen eik Dinar ka faeyda huwa , phir unhoney uski jagah eik Dinar mein doosra janwer kharida, qurbani ka janwer aur eik Dinar ley kar wo Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key paas aaye, to aap ney farmaya : ''bakri ki qurbani kar do aur Dinar ko sadqa kar do.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : Hakim bin Hizaam ki hadees ko hum sirf isi sanad sey jantey hain, aur merey nazdik Habib bin abi Sabit ka samaa (sun'na), Hakeem bin Hizaam sey Sabit nahin hai."
"1375","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney bakri kharidney key liye mujhey eik Dinar diya, to mainey us sey do bakriyan khareedin, phir un mein sey eik ko eik Dinar mein bech diya aur eik bakri aur eik Dinar ley kar Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key paas aaya, aur aap sey tamam maamla bayan kiya aur aap ney farmaya : ''Allah tumhen tumharey haath key sodey mein barkat dey.''  phir uskey baad wo Koofa key kunasa ki taraf jatey aur bahut ziyada munaafa kamatey they. chunanche wo Koofa key sab sey ziyada maaldaar aadmi bin gaey. Muallif ney Ahmed bin Saeed Darmi key turq sey Zuber bin Khirrit sey isi tarah ki hadees riwayat ki. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- baaz ehle-ilm isi hadees ki taraf gaey hain aur wo isi key qaail hain aur yehi Ahmed aur Is-haq bin Raahviya ka bhi qol hai. baaz ehle-ilm ney is hadees ko nahin liya hai, inhin logon mein Shafai aur Hammad bin Zaid Saeed bin Zaid key bhai hain."
"1376","Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''jab makatib ghulam (wo ghulam jo apni qeemat khud ada karke apne aap ko azaad kara le) kisi diyat ya meeras ka mustahiq ho to usi key mutabiq wo hissey paeyga jitna wo azad kya ja chuka hai.'' neez (isi ke saath) aap ney farmaya : ''makatib jitna zare-kitaabat ada kar chuka hai itni azadi key mutabiq diyat diya jaeyga aur jo baqi hai uskey mutabiq ghulam ki diyat di jaeygi.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ibne-Abbas Raziallahu anhuma ki hadees Hasan hai. 2- isi tarah Yahya bin abi Kasir ney Ikrima sey aur ikrima ney ibne-Abbas sey aur ibne-Abbas ney Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey riwayat ki hai. 3- is bab mein Umme-Salma (Raziallahu Anha) sey bhi riwayat hai, 4- lekin Khalid Haza ney bhi Ikrima sey (riwayat ki hai magar unkey mutabiq) Ikrima ney Ali (Raziallahu anhu) key qol sey riwayat ki hai. 5- Sahaba kiram waghaira mein sey baaz ehle-ilm ka isi hadees par amal hai. aur Sahaba kiram waghaira mein sey aksar ehle-ilm ka kehna hai ke jab tak makatib par eik dirham bhi baqi hai wo ghulam hai, Sufiyan Sory , Shafai , Ahmed aur Is-haq bin Raahviya ka bhi yehi qol hai."
"1377","Mainey Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ko khutbe key doran kehtey suna : ''jo apney ghulam sey sau auqiya (baara sau dirham) par makatibat (likhaee) karey aur wo das auqiya key ilawa tamam ada kar dey phir baqi ki adaegi sey wo aajiz rahey to wo ghulam hi rahega.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan gharib hai. 2- Hujjaaj bin Irtaat ney bhi Amr bin Shuaib sey Isi tarah ki hadees riwayat ki hai. 3- Sahaba kiram waghaira mein sey aksar ehle-ilm ka isi par amal hai ke jab tak makatib par kuch bhi zare (maal) kitaabat baqi hai wo ghulam hi rahega۔"
"1378","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' jab tum mein sey kisi key makatib ghulam key paas itni raqam ho ke wo zare (maal) kitaabat ada kar sakey to usey us sey parda karna chahiye.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- ehle-ilm ka is hadees par amal zaiye darna aur taqwa aur ehtiyat hai. ye log kehtey hain ke makatib ghulam jab tak zare kitaabat na ada kar dey azad nahin hoga agar-che uskey paas zare kitaabat ada karney key liye raqam mojud ho."
"1379","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''jo (qarz daar) aadmi muflis ho jaey aur (qarz deney wala) aadmi apna saman uskey paas bilkul waise hi paey to wo us saman ka doosrey sey ziyada mustahiq hai.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- is bab mein Samura aur ibne-Umar (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi hadeesen aai hain. 3- baaz ehle-ilm ka isi par amal hai aur yehi Shafai , Ahmed aur Is-haq bin Raahviya ka bhi qol hai, aur baaz ehle-ilm kehtey hain : wo bhi doosrey qarz khuwahon (chaahne walon) ki tarah hoga, yehi ehle-Koofa ka bhi qol hai."
"1380","hamarey paas eik yatim ki sharab thi, jab Sura al-Maeyda nazil hui (jis mein sharab ki hurmat mazkur (zikr) hai) to mainey Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey uskey barey mein puchha aur arz kiya ke wo eik yatim ki hai? to aap ney farmaya : ''usey baha do.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- aur bhi sanadon sey ye Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey isi tarah marvi (riwayat hui) hai. 3- is bab mein Anas bin Malik (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, 4- baaz ehle-ilm isi key qaail hain, ye log sharab ka sirka bananey ko makrooh samajhtey hain, is wajeh sey isey makrooh qarar diya gaya hai ke musalman key ghar mein sharab rahey yahan tak ke wo sirka bin jaey ( Allah ki qism"
"1381","Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''jo tumharey paas amanat rakhey usey amanat lotaao padhi. aur jo tumharey sath khayanat karey uskey sath (bhi) khayanat na karo.''  Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan gharib hai. 2- baaz ehle-ilm isi hadees ki taraf gaey hain, wo kehtey hain ke jab aadmi ka kisi doosrey ke zimme koi chiz ho aur wo usey ley kar chala jaey phir us janey waley ki koi chiz uskey haath mein aaye to uskey liye jayez nahin hai ke is mein sey itna rok ley jitna wo uska ley kar gaya hai. 3- Tabe-een mein sey baaz ehle-ilm ney iski ijazat di hai, aur yehi Sory ka bhi qol hai, wo kehtey hain : agar uskey zimme dirham ho aur) bator amanat ( uskey paas uskey Dinar aagey to uskey liye jayez nahin ke wo apney daraahim key badley usey rok ley, albatta uskey paas uskey daraahim aa jaeyn to us waqt uskey liye durust hoga ke uskey daraahim mein sey itna rok ley jitna uskey zimme uska hai."
"1382","Mainey Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ko Hajjatul-wadaa key saal khutbe mein farmatey suna : ''Udhaar li hui chiz lautaai jaeygi, zaamin ko tawaan (jurmaana) dena hoga aur qarz adaa karna wajib hoga.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- abu-Umama (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadees Hasan gharib hai. 2- aur ye abu-Umama key wastey sey Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey aur bhi tareeq sey marvi (riwayat hui) hai, padhi. 2- is bab mein Samura , Safwan bin Umayya aur Anas (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi hadeesen aai hain."
"1383","Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''jo kuchh haath ney liya hai jab tak wo usey ada na kar dey uskey zimme hai.''  Qatada kehtey hain : phir Hasan Basri is hadees ko bhool gaey aur kehney lagey ''jisney udhaar li hai'' wo tera ameen hai, is par tawaan (jurmaana) nahin hai, yani udhaar li hui chiz talaf (khatam) honey par tawaan nahin hai. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- Sahaba kiram waghaira mein sey baaz ehle-ilm isi taraf gaey hain ye log kehtey hain : udhaar leney wala zaamin hota hai. aur yehi Shafai aur Ahmed ka bhi qol hai. 3- Sahaba kiram waghaira mein sey baaz ehle-ilm kehtey hain ke Aariyatan (udhaar) leney waley par tawaan (jurmaana) nahin hai, siwaye iske ke wo saaman waley ki mukhalifat karey. Sory aur ehle-koofa ka yehi qol hai aur Is-haq bin Raahviya bhi isi key qaail hain."
"1384","Mainey Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ko farmatey suna : '' gunehgar hi  zakhira andozi (jama karna) karta hai.''  Muhammad bin Ibrahim kehtey hain : mainey Saeed bin Al Musaiyab sey kaha : abu Muhammad ! aap to zakhira andozi kartey hain? unhoney kaha : Maamar bhi Zakhira andozi kartey they. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Maamar ki hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- Saeed bin Musaiyab sey marvi hai, wo tel, gehun aur isi tarah ki chizon ki zakhira andozi (jama karna) kartey they. 3- is bab mein umr , Ali , abu-Umama , aur ibne-Umar (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi hadeesen aai hain. 4- ehle-ilm ka isi par amal hai. un logon ney khaney ki zakhira andozi najaaiz kaha hai. 5- baaz ehle-ilm ney khaney key ilawa deegar ashiya ki zakhira andozi ki ijazat di hai. 6- ibne-Mubarak kehtey hain : rui , dabaaghat di hui bakri ki khaal , aur isi tarah ki chizon ki zakhira andozi mein koi harj nahin hai."
"1385","Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''(baazaar mein aaney waley qafila tijarat ka bazar sey pehley) istaqbal na karo, janwer key than mein doodh na roko (taake kharidar dhoka kha jaey) aur (jhoota kharidar bin kar) eik doosrey ka saman na farokht karaao.''  Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ibne-Abbas Raziallahu anhuma ki hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- is bab mein ibne-Masood aur Abu-Hurera Raziallahu anhuma sey bhi hadeesen aai hain. 3- ehle-ilm ka isi par amal hai. ye log aisey janwer ki bai (saude) ko jis ka doodh than mein rok liya gaya ho jayez nahin samajhtey. 4- muhaffala aisey janwer ko kehtey hain jis ka doodh than mein chhodey rakha gaya ho, uska Malik kuchh din sey usey na dohtaa hota ke uski than mein doodh jama ho jaey aur kharidar us sey dhoka kha jaey. ye faraib aur dhoke hi ki eik shakal hai."
